  "query_preview": "/SUNDAY THROUGH SATURDAY/...\nIssued at 130 PM CST Sat Nov 7 2026\n\nWarmer and Mostly Dry Week: Ensemble Cluster Analysis continues\nto suggest a west/northwest flow pattern across our area for \nearly and mid week. Shortwave energy southwest of the area will\ncome close to the region on Tuesday but it looks to largely stay\nsouth. Another system then moves down from the northwest on\nWednesday. Ensembles suggest some rain potential with this \nquick hitting system however moisture is in question. Current \nprecip chances on Wednesday are in the 20-30% chance range. \nTemps in the 60s to around 70 are likely Monday and Tuesday then\na decrease is likely mid to late week as the trough and cooler \nair aloft moves through.",
